The generated prompt names the output dir `apps/apple/TeslaSync/Features/Admin/**`.
That path does NOT exist in this repo and is NOT a project.yml source group (the
`TeslaSync/` dir holds only the widget/feature-view surface groups). The repo's real,
compiled canonical page home is `apps/apple/Sources/Features/<Domain>/` — `Sources` is a
project.yml source path (createIntermediateGroups), and the DONE sibling
`page:admin/ApiPlayground` already ships at `Sources/Features/Admin/`. The page therefore
ships at `apps/apple/Sources/Features/Admin/**`, the faithful equivalent of the prompt's
